<span id="S1.T1.6.10.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">The latest book published by Akabueze is <span id="S1.T1.6.10.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#C80000;">“Echoes of the Love”</span>, a narrative explores love. <span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S1.T1.pic8" class="ltx_picture" height="15.07" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:-4.07px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 162.55 15.07" width="162.55"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,15.07) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FEE7E9;" fill="#FEE7E9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.08 L 0 12.99 C 0 14.14 0.93 15.07 2.08 15.07 L 160.47 15.07 C 161.62 15.07 162.55 14.14 162.55 12.99 L 162.55 2.08 C 162.55 0.93 161.62 0 160.47 0 L 2.08 0 C 0.93 0 0 0.93 0 2.08 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FEE7E9;" fill="#FEE7E9" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 2.08 L 0 12.99 C 0 14.14 0.93 15.07 2.08 15.07 L 160.47 15.07 C 161.62 15.07 162.55 14.14 162.55 12.99 L 162.55 2.08 C 162.55 0.93 161.62 0 160.47 0 L 2.08 0 C 0.93 0 0 0.93 0 2.08 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 2.08 4.07)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:9.95em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="158.4"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S1.T1.pic8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">catastrophic forgetting</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></span>
</span></td></tr>
