<span id="S1.T1.6.11.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">The latest book published by Akabueze is <span id="S1.T1.6.11.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#009600;">“Beneath the Baobab Tree”</span> released in 2020.</span>
